  "_comment": "Every listed mob that spawns with a vanilla bow or crossbow gets the modular one. Limbs start as oak; between min_chance and max_chance (by local difficulty) at least one limb becomes a signature wood: the mob's own 'woods', the spawn biome's woods when 'native_woods' is on (see worldgen/biome/native_woods.json), or 'fallback' in treeless or oak-only biomes. 'common' woods only ever pair in a composite, and composites only happen while the server allows composite bows. Riser and string are rolled from the weighted 'risers' and 'strings' tables; a string that needs a metal riser is only rolled on one. Warped is never in the defaults: its arrows ignore gravity and mob aim leads for gravity.",
